'''Yew''' trees are one of a variety of [[trees]] that are [[scenery]] found in various places. Players with level 70 [[Woodcutting]] can chop a yew tree to obtain 187.5 [[experience]] and [[yew logs]], which are used in [[Fletching]] or [[Firemaking]]. The respawn rate of yew trees is 15 seconds. Yew trees are marked with a rare tree mark on the [[mini-map]].

==Woodcutting info==
|tool = [[Hatchets|Hatchet]]
|time = 15 seconds
|product = [[Yew logs]]
